Package: OrganTransition
Type: Package
Title: Individual Organ-Specific Frailty Transition Scores
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jieteng", "Chen", email = "chenjieteng@westlake.edu.cn",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jieteng Chen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jieteng Chen <chenjieteng@westlake.edu.cn>
Description: Takes nine raw [0, 1] organ FI values, standardises them
    internally with frozen global means and standard deviations, computes the
    overall and per-organ transition scores with an age-stratified pair of
    Gaussian Bayesian reference networks, and returns their percentiles from
    frozen aggregated quantile tables, both overall and within age-sex matched
    strata. Raw transition-score values are not returned, no cohort label is
    required, and no individual-level reference data are included in the
    package.
